# components/rubato is a working clone of github.com/lylepmills/eurorack
# (Rubato Audio Plaits Lab). The full clone is ~150 MB of working tree, but the
# firmware build and the TBPalette engine-config generator only need the plaits
# subtree and the model catalog, so only those are committed.
/components/rubato/*
!/components/rubato/AGENTS.md
!/components/rubato/README.md
!/components/rubato/plaits/
/components/rubato/plaits/hardware_design/
/components/rubato/plaits/test/
/components/rubato/plaits/drivers/
/components/rubato/plaits/tools/
!/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/
/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/*
!/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_catalog/
/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_catalog/*
!/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_catalog/catalog.json
!/components/rubato/alt_firmwares/plaits_lab_catalog/README.md
